PHOTOPLASM — LICENSING

Copyright (c) 2026 Eric Schneider

Photoplasm follows a Pioreactor-style open-source model. Different parts of this
project carry different licenses, chosen to suit what each part is:

    Software        MIT License        permissive reuse, attribution required
    Hardware        CERN-OHL-S v2      strongly reciprocal
    Documentation   CC BY-SA 4.0       share-alike

The Photoplasm name, branding, proprietary know-how, unpublished processes, and
separately protected inventions are NOT covered by any of these licenses.
See section 4.


